`redactions_by_frame` in `scripts/frames/masks.json` is the write-time contract. It is narrowly
anchored to the boot dashboard; it does not redact transcript emails, UUIDs, paths, costs, durations,
percentages, token counts or timestamps. `by_frame` contains separate, dashboard-only comparison masks
for quota and status nondeterminism. Automated tests prove that the unredacted frames in commit
`d6b2b6d849` redact byte-for-byte to all eight stored fixtures and that an attempted unredacted
tracked-fixture write is refused.
